1363:> opposite outcomes. *"The fork already knows how to do this" is a weaker warrant than it sounds
1364:> when the same file contains both answers.*
1365:
1366:**Site count is EIGHT across three CPUs, in three UB regions** (count >= width, `1 << 31` signed
