1371:`panel_20260907_192452`, six seats. **grok's verdict: RATIFY THE REPAIR; DO NOT RATIFY THE
1372:COMMENTS, THE "11/11 PINS BOTH HALVES" READING, OR THE 496-COUNT.** All four packet-fed seats
1373:independently confirmed the mask is correct at 1, 31 and 32 and that the `&&` reorder changes no
1374:guest value.
1375:
1376:*** THREE ONE-LINE ESCAPES, AND THE VALUABLE PART IS WHY TWO OF THEM CANNOT BE CLOSED. ***
1377:
1378:| escape | why it survived a full score |
1379:|---|---|
