tools/pipeline/ledger.json:33103:     "note": "BITS/BYTES SIBLING HUNT.  VERDICT: *\"No additional bits/bytes sibling confirmed.  I found three unrelated dead guards, one always-true test, and a separate ARM shift-count defect.\"*  224 files screened, 60 sites traced across 18 files.  A NEGATIVE RESULT WITH A DENOMINATOR is the useful shape here.  Its three by-products: the dec21143 dead clamps (-> `dec21143deadclamp'), the always-true `writeback_len > 1', and *** the ARM bit-field shift, which led to `armbfiwidth' -- a LIVE third site #510 missed. ***  Cleared two near-miss candidates by deriving their domains (sgi_gbe `8 << (field & 3)' -> {1,2,4,8} bytes; dev_px `bitdepth >> 3' -> {1,3})."
