tools/pipeline/ledger.json:33443:     "note": "GPT-6 Astra @ max, on the c0c7f55 diff.  'The checkout DIFFERS from the supplied text: handler comments revised, row list adds s w32 pc and s w31' -- the row moved after the commit under review.  'It repairs observable WIDTH-32 BEHAVIOUR as well as definedness' -- the same behaviour-change finding the armbfiwidth ruling turned on.  FOUR weakening cells with NO BUILT MUTANT: UBFX full-width selection relaxed to admit 31 (the supplied w31 row would distinguish); SBFX the same (the CHECKOUT's added s w31 would); SBFX's width restriction on sign-bit evaluation (derived equivalent); SBFX sign-bit requirement dropped (the s clear row would distinguish).  Each 'would' is a derivation, not a score.",
