tools/pipeline/ledger.json:34430:   "witness": "harness: the subject IS the panel apparatus, so the ladder's `harness:` term applies.  Proof is the pair of runs: regress/artifacts/armbfiwidth/codex_fixdesign_20260907.err (refused, 0-byte .txt) against the same seat's 296 KB answer in _scratchpad/panel_20260907_233310/codex.txt minutes earlier.",
