tools/pipeline/ledger.json-34507-   "title": "cpu_arm_instr.c: the bfi decoder accepts source field 15 and passes r[15] to X(bfi), but the architecture assigns that encoding to BFC (Bit Field Clear) -- so BFC is decoded as `BFI with Rn = PC'",
