tools/pipeline/fable_queue.md:2394:Six seats ratify the guard: grok *"ship `{1,2,3}  INVALIDATE_VADDR, else INVALIDATE_ALL`"*; codex
tools/pipeline/fable_queue.md:2395:*"retain the bounded guard, recognise -1/-2 explicitly"*; deepseek, kimi, minimax and glm concur.
